<title>POLAND: BRE AUG NET RISES TO PLN 12.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>BRE AUG NET RISES TO PLN 12.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					 12.22 vs    8.84</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   17.73 vs   12.63</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 28.48 vs   23.28</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	44.56 vs   33.44</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit					 92.44 vs   66.82</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  139.19 vs  111.91</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		219.98 vs  177.25</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     315.93 vs  228.41</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Rozwoju Exportu SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
